<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-10-19T17:37:21.028Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 17:37:21 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippines summoned China’s ambassador after a Chinese official warned that China could easily win a war, prompting lawmakers to call for a review of water-cannon use against Chinese vessels. Vice Admiral Rommel Supangan assumed command of the Philippine Coast Coast Guard, which rescued four people, including a child, on Hagonoy Island in Surigao del Sur. Chinese coast guard and navy ships entered waters near the Pratas Islands and Scarborough Shoal, while Taiwan’s coast guard and maritime forces repelled 16 mainland vessels in a coordinated operation. The United States and the Philippines held their 16th bilateral maritime exercise in the West Philippine Sea, and the PCG conducted an anti-piracy drill with Japan, and there were 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxOc3FaYjBYTmVBQW92UE1KRF9pRUNjX2wybVktN1RVY25Ka2Y4RTF4STRwUkdmbGJheTBLRkpMUkl0dzZ1Qk9vd1JNaGRPR0JUQ0NXemtnZGQ0Z0JwUTdSMkg2NlJPWjJ2TXdJamtwOF94NFB1TVhIeG9PamI0eWx3SkV5azZIVlJoSkRKUEtZQ05Cem1SX29PWTkwOFlMeHNj?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sri Lanka Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxORXVhRFhnMXVWZ19iNXZoeVFwT3g0WnVPYzlhOUI4aml5eXNLcmVzWGl3SWtEQTNaenZKQ0tudUZBVVF6Nlp2a0pRTnNJYWlxTURWSHRwU281UjJLWnVHQTFXUUVxTWkyeHdjbGowVjBhcnN2SUdXdXNoQ3VLcV9uaVY5QnFxbE9va0ZnTUFMZDFNbWVmTDVRbXM1YkVmUnhVQlAzN1R0SmpwNDZhakp4d1YzS2tkQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxQWjZPSW5rZkhzUHcweWlaeTRxN1h5VDEwMnNJNjJnMDFsSUppQjhMYWR1OHJwd0VVMTRTcFh4c2xMQW1pSG9VeVhpMjJqdlR5ZzNZME5jVWlnaGtLRUtRajlidDlVSmtuTzRnNWM5Yy1halFSRy1vdmxrdng2YlFEdT